# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
# Two overlapping blocks over the same rows: a row with region "N" and status "open" lands in both.
Load accounts as t.
If region is "N":
    Keep only the columns account_id, region.
    Show the result as north_accounts.
If status is "open" or region is "N":
    Compute account_id * 2 as twice.
    Show the result as open_accounts.
Sort that by account_id.
